:null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107048","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107048","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107048.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107048.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Summary\r\n\r\nReplaces deprecated [`[UIScreen mainScreen].scale`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uiscreen/main?language=objc)  \r\nwith [`[UITraitCollection currentTraitCollection].displayScale`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uitraitcollection/displayscale?language=objc)  \r\nin `DisplayServerIOS::screen_get_scale`.\r\n\r\nThis change ensures forward compatibility with iOS versions beyond 18.5, where `UIScreen.mainScreen` is deprecated.\r\n\r\n### Implementation details\r\n\r\n- Falls back to `UIScreen.mainScreen.scale` on iOS versions prior to 13.\r\n- Uses `MAX(..., 1.0)` to preserve the original behavior of ensuring a minimum scale of 1.\r\n\r\n### Tested on\r\n\r\n- iPhone 16 Pro Max (iOS 18.5)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107048/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107048/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}